[174.636088, "o", "PASS baseline-resistance: The resistant target halved the unmarked 8 Fire attack (expected \"4\", actual \"4\")\r\nPASS foreign-mark-prepared: The target is marked by another ready hunter while the attacking hunter is also ready (expected \"true\", actual \"true\")\r\nPASS foreign-mark-resistant: Another hunter's mark does not bypass resistance for the ready attacker (expected \"4\", actual \"4\")\r\n"]
